    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>public eulogy</i> on great men,
			sometimes accompanied by the flute: hence, <i>lament, dirge,</i>
			only in Lat. <i>nenia,</i> a Gr. word acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Legg.</u>
				2.24.62
			</span></i>; cf. sq.</div>
